      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَآْءٌ مَأْمُوتٌ</span></b>  <i>A water of which the distance is
computed,</i> or <i>conjectured.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُوَ إِلَى أَجَلٍ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَاْمُوتٍ</span> <i>It is until a determined, defined,</i> or
<i>definite, period.</i> (S, K. *) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَىْءٌ مَأْمُوتٌ</span> <i>A thing
that is known.</i> (M, TA.) [And so <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَوْمُوتٌ</span>.]

